#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Source-level gates for the GenLayer milestone settlement release.

These checks make the milestone feature independently reviewable without
changing the existing deployed-case gates. Runtime checks remain authoritative
and are run by ``scripts/milestone_verify.sh``.
"""

